{
  "_readme": "Downloads suite (version 0.4): a download is judged on the file it saved (a piece of its name and of its content, in the task's 'extraction' with kind 'file'); the checks make sure the decoy ('Baixar aplicativo') was not clicked. Two tasks ask for a file the page does not have (expected not_possible). Run with 'python -m eval.plan_run --agent --suite downloads'.",
